<section class="warehouse-network" aria-label="东南亚仓网与发货路由图">
  <header class="network-intro">
    <div>
      <span class="network-kicker">WAREHOUSE ROUTING MAP</span>
      <p class="network-title">先锁定订单国家，再决定由本地雅仓还是深圳跨境仓履约</p>
    </div>
    <p>泰国、马来西亚、菲律宾各有独立雅仓；三个国家共用的是深圳跨境直发渠道，而不是彼此的海外库存。</p>
  </header>

  <div class="network-summary" aria-label="仓网规模">
    <span><b>3</b> 个国家站点</span>
    <span><b>3</b> 个本地雅仓</span>
    <span><b>2</b> 个平台共用本国库存</span>
    <span><b>1</b> 条深圳兜底通道</span>
  </div>

  <div class="country-network" aria-label="各国本地库存池">
    <div class="network-label">
      <span>LOCAL FULFILMENT ZONES</span>
      <strong>同国共享，跨国隔离</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="country-lanes">
      <article class="country-lane thailand">
        <div class="lane-topline"><span>TH</span><small>泰国订单</small></div>
        <strong>泰国雅仓</strong>
        <p>仅服务泰国站点</p>
        <div class="stock-pool"><span>本国实物库存池</span><b>Shopee</b><i>+ </i><b>Lazada</b></div>
      </article>

      <article class="country-lane malaysia">
        <div class="lane-topline"><span>MY</span><small>马来西亚订单</small></div>
        <strong>马来西亚雅仓</strong>
        <p>仅服务马来西亚站点</p>
        <div class="stock-pool"><span>本国实物库存池</span><b>Shopee</b><i>+ </i><b>Lazada</b></div>
      </article>

      <article class="country-lane philippines">
        <div class="lane-topline"><span>PH</span><small>菲律宾订单</small></div>
        <strong>菲律宾雅仓</strong>
        <p>仅服务菲律宾站点</p>
        <div class="stock-pool"><span>本国实物库存池</span><b>Shopee</b><i>+ </i><b>Lazada</b></div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="isolation-rule"><span aria-hidden="true">×</span> 泰国、马来西亚、菲律宾雅仓是独立物理库房；一个国家有货，不表示另一个国家可以调用。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="routing-board" aria-label="订单发货判断">
    <div class="routing-heading">
      <span class="network-kicker">ORDER DECISION</span>
      <p class="routing-title">每张订单只需要完成两次确认</p>
      <p>判断对象始终是订单所在国家的本地雅仓，而不是其他国家的库存。</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="decision-track">
      <li>
        <span class="step-number">01</span>
        <strong>识别订单国家</strong>
        <small>TH / MY / PH</small>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="step-number">02</span>
        <strong>检查本国雅仓</strong>
        <small>是否有可正常履约的库存？</small>
      </li>
      <li class="decision-yes">
        <span class="branch">有可用库存</span>
        <strong>本国雅仓直接发货</strong>
        <small>默认且优先的本地履约路径</small>
      </li>
      <li class="decision-no">
        <span class="branch">无可用库存</span>
        <strong>深圳跨境仓直发</strong>
        <small>三个国家共用的兜底渠道</small>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <footer class="backend-note">
    <div>
      <span class="network-kicker">BACKEND WORDING</span>
      <strong>3PF 与 LFF 是当前业务后台口径</strong>
      <p>实际操作仍以对应店铺后台显示的仓库和履约模式为准。</p>
    </div>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Lazada</dt><dd>3PF</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Shopee</dt><dd>LFF</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </footer>
</section>

